Hey! It's the preview for the next episode

00:23:52.260 --> 00:23:55.000
of "The Iceblade Sorcerer 
Shall Rule the World"!

00:23:55.000 --> 00:23:57.070
Ray faces off against this massive monster!

00:23:57.070 --> 00:24:01.970
Can he defeat it and finish this 
insane practical exercise in one piece?!

00:24:01.970 --> 00:24:06.070
The boy who became the world's 
strongest sorcerer enjoys a day off!

00:24:05.500 --> 00:24:10.000
